ui.c48f8b400a29:
save_project {C:/folder/project.fcnproj}
save_project {C:/folder/project.FlatPrj}
Required extension defines format; replaces destination after serialization. Close editors first. .FlatPrj preserves only Python-representable features; also keep .fcnproj. Cancellation before publishing preserves destination; compression cannot be interrupted midway.

ui.23128c50315d:
scale {name} 2 -origin center
scale {name} -x 2 -y 1 -origin {(3,4)}
Reference: center (default), origin, min_bounds or x,y. Omitted axis: 1; zero factor rejected.

ui.ea9ac619f27f:
mirror {name} -axis X -origin 0,0
mirror {name} -axis Y -box {reference}
X reflects Y; Y reflects X (default). -box uses reference center and overrides -origin. Without reference: (0,0).
